WEBVTT

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:57.800
What are you doing?

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.710
Minai!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.670
It's your job to defeat that Corpse.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:06.850
Take your pride as Shikabane Hime and give it the final blow!

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:14.450
I'll get scolded by Bishop Tagami for letting a Shikabane Hime that's still regenerating it's body help you.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:15.900
Above that...

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:22.690
It's forbidden to distance yourself from your Contracted Priest and getting into a fight alone.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.410
Minai!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.080
You'll get hurt if you attack it!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:34.080
If I can concentrate myself enough, I can defeat it before the curse takes effect.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.680
I have to do it, because I've been ordered to.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.270
Minai!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.210
You monster!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.860
I am justice.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.090
Justice is me.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.600
It's over!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.870
Mitsuyoshi?

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.130
Is that you, Mitsuyoshi?

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.800
I didn't know you were friends with Oori!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.540
I'm so glad.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:33.920
Are you doing well?

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.560
I was so worried after reading your blog.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.710
Come on, talk to me.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:40.490
Let's meet up once in a while.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.290
Note: frontal attack in kendo
Men!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.230
Sumitori.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:04.120
Mitsuyoshi?

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.010
Can you hear me?

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.330
Mitsuyoshi?

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.040
Do you still practice kendo?

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.690
Did you get any better?

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.270
Did you know they completely renovated our middle school's kendo dojo last year?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.530
Why don't we go and take a look at it.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.000
Sumitori.
Why don't we go and take a look at it.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:17.040
Why don't we go and take a look at it.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.340
Hey?

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.350
Mitsuyoshi?

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.450
Can you hear me?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.050
Oori?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.010
Oori!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.140
I'm sorry, Sumi.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.380
If you were going to make such a face...

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.580
...you didn't have to call him in the first place.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.380
Are you alright, Minai?

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.780
Why are you only calling her by her name?

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:03.540
Minai!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:04.230
We're leaving!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.030
Hey, Minai!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.610
I'm alright.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.990
I don't think of these wounds as a punishment anymore.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.050
A punishment?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:22.030
Because I'm not a human, I'm a Shikabane Hime, I can keep on fighting getting wounded.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.900
Because I can protect you.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:30.140
I learned  to have pride even not being human.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.590
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.220
It’s nothing really.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.780
Are your wounds healing properly?

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.550
If there is anything else you need, feel free to ask.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.200
I've gone through a lot of trouble for you.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.240
You can make it up to me by kneeling down and licking the back of my feet.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.470
Why are you saying such sinister things?!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.750
Oh, all right.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.830
I'll just stop telling the truth.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.340
I didn't say or think anything like that!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.430
What are you doing, Shikei?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.560
I was really sorry, so I...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.310
Just let him lick them.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.500
With pleasure!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.570
Please stop it.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.650
I really didn't think any of those things.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.130
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:32.960
Please.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.760
I choose what I wanted to eat myself!

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:41.030
I reported to old man Tagami about the betrayer monk case.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.500
And also about another case.

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:46.670
The one about your brother, Shikei, right?

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.960
That guy is just running around on his own intuition.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:56.560
He's his brother, why don't you let him join the Kougon-cult and let him become a Contracted Priest?

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.520
Let him connect with Minai and everything will be fine.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:04.000
I won’t let him get involved any more than he is already.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.800
But you are Makina-chan's Contracted Priest, Shikei.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.840
Asking not to get him involved at all is impossible.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.640
I know, but I've already made my decision.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.080
I'll keep my promise to Makina.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.470
And I won't let Oori come near us.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:24.170
Both are very important to me.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:27.830
You're just acting cool, old man.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.700
You're just afraid what she would do to you if you fail again.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.480
Note: pika = electricity, probably means her being angry.
Isn't that right, moody?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.070
I'm not thinking any of that, really!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.040
Oori!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.660
Can you explain to me how you met Mitsuyoshi?

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.970
Well, I...

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.180
It's difficult to explain.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.600
So what happened to Mitsuyoshi?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.220
Sorry!

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.400
I promise you I'll explain it to you next time.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:02.540
I just hope he's alright.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:15.160
This cell phone is evidence of that Corpse, because you accessed it's blog with it.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.940
Isn't that Kan-san's job?

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.310
Why did you come all the way just for this?

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.720
Because I thought it had to be confiscated quickly.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.980
And also because I happened to be in the neighborhood.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:32.200
I understand you need to confiscate it, but I'm losing my cell phone.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.670
We'll just transfer your number to a new one.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.470
I will pay for the charges.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.320
We could go to the shop after school if you like.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.650
Kagami.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.380
What is it, Sensei?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:52.370
I'm telling you this as your brother's college, not as your teacher.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.150
I'm sure you understand this, but a Shikabane Hime isn't human.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:00.020
How much it may look like a cute girl.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.210
What a horrible way to say it.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:09.740
Damned Minai.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.090
Where have you gone?

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.460
I'm different from them.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.100
What is it?!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.790
You guys are...

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:33.700
Let me go!

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:34.620
Damn!

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.860
Note: this shop is referring to the Japanese mobile phone operator ‘AU’, popular among students.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.860
Please confiscate it.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:56.510
I'm sorry to have caused you trouble.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:57.890
Don't worry about it.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:00.500
Do you have a cell phone, Minai?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.780
Yes, I need it to stay in contact with my Contracted Priest.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.350
Won't you give me your number?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:15.200
It has become difficult to ask Hoshimura-san about my brother, you know.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.190
It's alright.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.750
I'll send it, OK?

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:43.930
Minai?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.960
What's wrong, Minai?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.020
Minai?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.220
Are you OK, Minai?

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:01.830
Impossible.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:04.470
It was just the beginning.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.210
So it is certain.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.510
The information bureau confirms it.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:25.730
The Contracted Priest, Isaki Shuuji, has been murdered this afternoon.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:30.700
According to the witnesses, he was quarreling with two youngsters.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.310
And got stabbed with a knife soon after.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:38.150
Trouble with some brats?

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.300
We must check all the surroundings.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.340
Bring a burial cloth for Bishop Isaki.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.130
Yes sir.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.860
What about Isaki's doll?

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.080
Doll?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.000
His Shikabane Hime.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.140
Wasn't she near him?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:07.750
Saki?

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:10.290
I'm sure Itsuki will come alone.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:10.680
But...

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.110
I don't want him to see what we're going to do now.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:22.480
A Shikabane Hime and her Contracted Priest have a strong bond we call 'the link'.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:27.000
The Contracted Priest is what keeps the Shikabane Hime something we can call human.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:31.680
But if a Shikabane Hime lives after the Contracted Pries is dead...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.440
...she's just another Corpse.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.370
So that's why sometimes a Shikabane Hime...

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:40.280
...needs to kill another Shikabane Hime.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:42.980
Makina?

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:44.630
I'm going to watch.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.180
The way a Shikabane Hime dies.

00:12:59.030 --> 00:12:59.820
Why?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:00.780
Minai?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:01.310
It just started.

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.290
Minai, what’s wrong?
It just started.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:02.330
Minai, what’s wrong?

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:03.940
Minai?

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.060
Hey, Minai?

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.710
Shut up!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:10.960
I'm sorry.

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:12.450
No.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.070
Oori.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:13.800
Minai?

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.520
I am...

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.600
It's alright, Minai.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.880
No, it's not!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.350
It's no use!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.360
I may only be 10 years old.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:43.030
But my Contracted Priest, Aragami Rika, is a member of one of the Ten Great Holy Families.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:53.640
They're the descendants of the ten senior disciples of the founder.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:57.040
You're nothing compared to a Shikabane Hime like me.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:58.820
No.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.070
You must know it.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.680
No, you must have felt it.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.400
Your Contracted Priest has died.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.840
I heard it was a terrible incident.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.970
You murdered a man and committed suicide.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:19.320
You became a Shikabane Hime thanks to that attachment to this world.

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.760
But that's all over now!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.350
She blocked it.

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:43.900
Why are two of them fighting?

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:49.770
If a Shikabane Hime that has lost her Contracted Priest doesn't get annihilated...

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.130
..she'll become a mere Corpse.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.010
I don't want to die.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.240
Did you forget we're all dead already?

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.440
I've been told "thank you".

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.770
Thank you.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.540
I thought it was just an attachment.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.840
But now it's different.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:23.260
Even if a Shikabane Hime is a monster, it wasn't a punishment to me.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.860
I can save people.

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.630
It's the first time I have felt this way.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.610
I finally understand it.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.470
What I have to do.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:34.990
Don't speak any more!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:53.610
Forgive me.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.090
Let's run away.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.040
Oori-kun!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.450
It's not Minai anymore.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.130
It's already a Corpse.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:11.770
Let's run away!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.050
Oori-kun!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:15.790
Damn it.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.630
Makina-chan?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.460
A Shikabane Hime is actually a Contracted Priest's shield.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.710
Usually the Corpse Princess dies before the monk.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.200
What a boring life.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.270
It's rare, but things like this happen.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.360
But it's the first time I heard a priest dying after getting stabbed by a few brats.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:49.970
Are you sure you don't want to go?

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.710
It's not our problem.

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:57.450
We would have to annihilate it, if we pass it in town.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.290
but I want to try not getting involved too much.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.010
I don't know what to say about that.

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:06.420
Eh...

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:07.970
I'm sorry to interrupt.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.730
Could you watch over a friend for a while?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.350
Just until this evening.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:19.470
These two look grumpy, but they'll take care of you.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.760
Where's Minai?

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:34.300
Wait!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:40.300
Did you hide her somewhere and are you trying to lure us somewhere else?

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.350
How admirable.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.250
Why do you want to kill her?

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.660
Because a Shikabane Hime that lost her Contracted Priest is just another Corpse.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.020
Minai said she wants to protect people.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.160
Fight for justice you mean?!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.000
Don't you think that's an attachment to this world?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.230
Wanting to protect people...

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.270
Wanting to fight for justice...

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:10.520
If Minai is thinking of those things, it means she has become a Corpse with an attachment.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.870
That can't be.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:14.240
There is no mistake in her being just.

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:18.430
But if she gets focused on something, it is no different from other Corpses.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.030
Where is Minai?

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:30.060
Shikabane Hime's can sense each other, because we're all Corpses.

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.270
It's useless to hide her.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:41.860
Why are you...

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:43.840
Why are you fighting?

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.020
You don't have a reason, right?

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.330
More than you...

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.080
More than you, Minai is...

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:56.600
Do you know who we are?

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.280
I think so.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.950
The Kougon-cult has what you would call secret methods.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.580
Although the chance of success is small, there is something we can do.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:13.540
To find a Contracted Priest to replace the deceased Isaki.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.350
But that should be done immediately.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:20.660
If you get rid of the link with Isaki and get a new strong one with a new priest...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.520
...you might be able to keep on being a Shikabane Hime.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.300
But the problem is to find a suitable Contracted Priest, right?

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:34.530
Someone who already has a real strong connection with her is difficult to find.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:36.710
What about Keisei's little brother?

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:40.000
He's worried about you.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.410
You already have a emotional connection.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.960
Are you serious?

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.440
He isn't even a priest.

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:50.610
I think it's possible to skip that and continue on to the Contract part.

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:56.350
I...

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.820
I...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.070
Yo, Oori.

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.360
It's huge!

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.510
What happened?

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:06.070
A priest got stabbed at that parking lot.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.270
The suspects are students from our school.

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:13.260
I heard it was someone Sumi knew since his middle school.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:17.050
A priest got stabbed?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:22.490
Ouch!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.970
What are you doing?

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:25.320
Don't do that!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:26.640
Oori?

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:35.770
I am Isaki Shuuji’s Shikabane Hime.

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.400
What a distinguished service.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:39.790
Did you get hurt?

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:40.910
No.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.410
Then I'll remove the body.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.000
Hey?

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.350
What about the burial cloth?

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:54.460
That cloth is for priests above the Gon Bishop or died in the line of duty.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:56.660
So we did not prepare any.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.790
Didn't this one die for the cult?

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:07.900
Did you prepare it?

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.290
Yes.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:12.320
I was told the same thing from Tagami Shikei.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.000
I see.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:25.930
We could have saved her if we made Oori her Contracted Priest.

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:29.490
